\tab    Current Program filename applies.  As shown in Figure 6 below,\par
 \tab    if the new Current Program file does not exist, a new file\par
 \tab    will automatically be created in the \i Current_Program_Files\i0\par
 \tab    directory.  When the command exits, the Current Program\par
 \tab    filename will permanently be changed to \i MYPROGRAM.PAL\i0  unless\par
 \tab    and until another \i Set Current Program\i0  command is executed.\par
